{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack AI is a lightweight, type-safe SDK for building production-ready AI experiences. Its framework-agnostic core provides type-safe tool/function calling, streaming responses, and first-class React and Solid integrations, with adapters for multiple LLM providers — enabling predictable, composable, and testable AI features across any stack."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build a streaming React chat in "},{"type":"link","href":"../tutorials/basic-chat","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Basic Chat"}]},{"type":"text","value":". The key stays in the tab."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Serve a tool, a resource, and a prompt in "},{"type":"link","href":"../tutorials/mcp-server","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Build an MCP Server"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generate an image from a prompt in "},{"type":"link","href":"../tutorials/generate-image","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Generate Image"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Stream a typed table from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"chat({ outputSchema })"},{"type":"text","value":" in "},{"type":"link","href":"../tutorials/streaming-structured-table","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Streaming Structured Table"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Add three named agents (researcher, SEO, and writer) to a blog-writing chat in "},{"type":"link","href":"../tutorials/subagents","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Subagents"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"key-features","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Key Features"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-Safe"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Full TypeScript support with Zod schema inference"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Streaming"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Built-in streaming support for real-time responses"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Isomorphic Tools"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Define once with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toolDefinition()"},{"type":"text","value":", implement with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".server()"},{"type":"text","value":" or "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".client()"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Framework Agnostic"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Core library works anywhere"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Multiple Providers"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama, and more"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Typed Decisions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Ask "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"choice"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"score"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"boolean"},{"type":"text","value":" questions with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"decide()"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Approval Flow"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Built-in support for tool approval workflows"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Automatic Execution"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Both server and client tools execute automatically"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Users can paste their own provider API keys in the browser. See "},{"type":"link","href":"../advanced/byok","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Bring Your Own Key"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"framework-agnostic","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Framework Agnostic"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The framework-agnostic core of TanStack AI provides the building blocks for creating AI experiences in any environment, including:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next.js"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - API routes and App Router"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack Start"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - React Start or Solid Start (recommended!)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remix 3"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Controllers return SSE. Call "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"createChat"},{"type":"text","value":" in a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"clientEntry"},{"type":"text","value":" island"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Native / Expo"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Native chat screens with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChat"},{"type":"text","value":", absolute server URLs, and XHR streaming transports"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Express"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Node.js server"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React Router v7"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Loaders and actions"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TanStack AI lets you define a tool once and provide environment-specific implementations. Using "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toolDefinition()"},{"type":"text","value":" to declare the tool's input/output types and the server behavior with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".server()"},{"type":"text","value":" (or a client implementation with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".client()"},{"type":"text","value":"). These isomorphic tools can be invoked from the AI runtime regardless of framework."}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { chat, toolDefinition } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { openaiText } from '@tanstack/ai-openai'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\nimport { db } from './db'\n\n// Define a tool\nconst getProductsDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: 'getProducts',\n  description: 'Search for products by query',\n  inputSchema: z.object({ query: z.string() }),\n  outputSchema: z.array(z.object({ id: z.string(), name: z.string() })),\n})\n\n// Create server implementation\nconst getProducts = getProductsDef.server(async ({ query }) => {\n  return await db.products.search(query)\n})\n\n// Use in AI chat\nchat({\n  adapter: openaiText('gpt-5.2'),\n  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'Find products' }],\n  tools: [getProducts]\n})","lang":"typescript"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"core-packages","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Core Packages"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The TanStack AI ecosystem consists of several packages:"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tanstack-ai","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The core AI library that provides:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"AI adapter interface for connecting to LLM providers"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Chat completion and streaming"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Isomorphic tool/function calling system"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Agent loop strategies"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-safe tool definitions with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"toolDefinition()"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-safe Model Options based on adapter & model selection"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-safe content modalities (text, image, audio, video, document) based on model capabilities"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tanstack-ai-client","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-client"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A framework-agnostic headless client for managing chat state:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Message management with full type safety"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Streaming support"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Connection adapters (SSE, HTTP stream, custom)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Automatic tool execution (server and client)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tool approval flow handling"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tanstack-ai-react","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-react"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"React hooks for TanStack AI:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChat"},{"type":"text","value":" hook for chat interfaces"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Automatic state management"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tool approval flow support"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-safe message handling with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InferChatMessages"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tanstack-ai-solid","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-solid"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Solid hooks for TanStack AI:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChat"},{"type":"text","value":" hook for chat interfaces"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Automatic state management"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tool approval flow support"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type-safe message handling with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"InferChatMessages"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tanstack-ai-octane","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-octane"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Octane hooks for TanStack AI:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useChat"},{"type":"text","value":" hook for chat interfaces"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Same hook names as "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-react"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Compiled by the Octane plugin from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":".tsrx"},{"type":"text","value":" source"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"adapters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Adapters"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"With the help of adapters, TanStack AI can connect to various LLM providers. Available adapters include:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-openrouter"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - OpenRouter (300+ models via a single API key — recommended)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-openai"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - OpenAI (GPT series)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-anthropic"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Anthropic (Claude)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-gemini"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Google Gemini"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-vertex"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Gemini on Google Vertex AI. Claude, Grok, and Mistral on Vertex live on "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-anthropic/vertex"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-grok/vertex"},{"type":"text","value":", and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"@tanstack/ai-mistral/vertex"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-ollama"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Ollama (local models)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-groq"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Groq"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-grok"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - xAI Grok"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-bedrock"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Amazon Bedrock (Claude, Nova, Llama, and more via AWS)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-byteplus"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - BytePlus (Seed chat, Seedance video, Seedream image, Seed Speech)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-fal"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - fal (image & video generation)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-reactor"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Reactor (live world and video generation: Orbis, Happy Oyster, LingBot, Helios, FastH3)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-worldlabs"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - World Labs Marble (persistent 3D world generation)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-llmgateway"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - LLM Gateway (hundreds of models via one OpenAI-compatible endpoint, self-hostable)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-cloudflare"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Cloudflare Workers AI (chat, embeddings, image, speech, transcription, evaluate) and AI Gateway routing"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-typesafe"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - TypeSafe Jev (typed evaluate decisions)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-ollaya"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - local Ollaya "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"laya"},{"type":"text","value":" models for typed evaluate decisions. No API key."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"@tanstack/ai-lovable"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Lovable AI Gateway (Google and OpenAI chat, image, video, embeddings, and speech via one project key)"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"next-steps","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Next Steps"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./quick-start","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Quick Start"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Add streaming chat. Pick your framework at the top of the page."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./quick-start-react-native","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Quick Start: React Native"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Add mobile chat with Expo and a server-owned provider boundary"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../evaluate/evaluate","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Evaluate"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Ask typed questions and branch on the answers"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../tools/tools","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tools Guide"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Learn about the isomorphic tool system"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"../api/ai","children":[{"type":"text","value":"API Reference"}]},{"type":"text","value":" - Explore the full API"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"key-features","text":"Key Features","level":2},{"id":"framework-agnostic","text":"Framework Agnostic","level":2},{"id":"core-packages","text":"Core Packages","level":2},{"id":"tanstack-ai","text":"@tanstack/ai","level":3},{"id":"tanstack-ai-client","text":"@tanstack/ai-client","level":3},{"id":"tanstack-ai-react","text":"@tanstack/ai-react","level":3},{"id":"tanstack-ai-solid","text":"@tanstack/ai-solid","level":3},{"id":"tanstack-ai-octane","text":"@tanstack/ai-octane","level":3},{"id":"adapters","text":"Adapters","level":2},{"id":"next-steps","text":"Next Steps","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nTanStack AI is a lightweight, type-safe SDK for building production-ready AI experiences. Its framework-agnostic core provides type-safe tool/function calling, streaming responses, and first-class React and Solid integrations, with adapters for multiple LLM providers — enabling predictable, composable, and testable AI features across any stack.\n\nBuild a streaming React chat in [Basic Chat](../tutorials/basic-chat). The key stays in the tab.\n\nServe a tool, a resource, and a prompt in [Build an MCP Server](../tutorials/mcp-server).\n\nGenerate an image from a prompt in [Generate Image](../tutorials/generate-image).\n\nStream a typed table from `chat({ outputSchema })` in [Streaming Structured Table](../tutorials/streaming-structured-table).\n\nAdd three named agents (researcher, SEO, and writer) to a blog-writing chat in [Subagents](../tutorials/subagents).\n\n## Key Features\n\n- ✅ **Type-Safe** - Full TypeScript support with Zod schema inference\n- ✅ **Streaming** - Built-in streaming support for real-time responses\n- ✅ **Isomorphic Tools** - Define once with `toolDefinition()`, implement with `.server()` or `.client()`\n- ✅ **Framework Agnostic** - Core library works anywhere\n- ✅ **Multiple Providers** - OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama, and more\n- ✅ **Typed Decisions** - Ask `choice`, `score`, and `boolean` questions with `decide()`\n- ✅ **Approval Flow** - Built-in support for tool approval workflows\n- ✅ **Automatic Execution** - Both server and client tools execute automatically\n\nUsers can paste their own provider API keys in the browser. See [Bring Your Own Key](../advanced/byok).\n\n## Framework Agnostic\n\nThe framework-agnostic core of TanStack AI provides the building blocks for creating AI experiences in any environment, including:\n\n- **Next.js** - API routes and App Router\n- **TanStack Start** - React Start or Solid Start (recommended!)\n- **Remix 3** - Controllers return SSE. Call `createChat` in a `clientEntry` island\n- **React Native / Expo** - Native chat screens with `useChat`, absolute server URLs, and XHR streaming transports\n- **Express** - Node.js server\n- **React Router v7** - Loaders and actions\n\nTanStack AI lets you define a tool once and provide environment-specific implementations. Using `toolDefinition()` to declare the tool's input/output types and the server behavior with `.server()` (or a client implementation with `.client()`). These isomorphic tools can be invoked from the AI runtime regardless of framework.\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toolDefinition } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { openaiText } from '@tanstack/ai-openai'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\nimport { db } from './db'\n\n// Define a tool\nconst getProductsDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: 'getProducts',\n  description: 'Search for products by query',\n  inputSchema: z.object({ query: z.string() }),\n  outputSchema: z.array(z.object({ id: z.string(), name: z.string() })),\n})\n\n// Create server implementation\nconst getProducts = getProductsDef.server(async ({ query }) => {\n  return await db.products.search(query)\n})\n\n// Use in AI chat\nchat({\n  adapter: openaiText('gpt-5.2'),\n  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'Find products' }],\n  tools: [getProducts]\n})\n```\n\n## Core Packages\n\nThe TanStack AI ecosystem consists of several packages:\n\n### `@tanstack/ai`\nThe core AI library that provides:\n- AI adapter interface for connecting to LLM providers\n- Chat completion and streaming\n- Isomorphic tool/function calling system\n- Agent loop strategies\n- Type-safe tool definitions with `toolDefinition()`\n- Type-safe Model Options based on adapter & model selection\n- Type-safe content modalities (text, image, audio, video, document) based on model capabilities\n\n### `@tanstack/ai-client`\nA framework-agnostic headless client for managing chat state:\n- Message management with full type safety\n- Streaming support\n- Connection adapters (SSE, HTTP stream, custom)\n- Automatic tool execution (server and client)\n- Tool approval flow handling\n\n### `@tanstack/ai-react`\nReact hooks for TanStack AI:\n- `useChat` hook for chat interfaces\n- Automatic state management\n- Tool approval flow support\n- Type-safe message handling with `InferChatMessages`\n\n### `@tanstack/ai-solid`\nSolid hooks for TanStack AI:\n- `useChat` hook for chat interfaces\n- Automatic state management\n- Tool approval flow support\n- Type-safe message handling with `InferChatMessages`\n\n### `@tanstack/ai-octane`\nOctane hooks for TanStack AI:\n- `useChat` hook for chat interfaces\n- Same hook names as `@tanstack/ai-react`\n- Compiled by the Octane plugin from `.tsrx` source\n\n## Adapters\n\nWith the help of adapters, TanStack AI can connect to various LLM providers. Available adapters include:\n\n- **@tanstack/ai-openrouter** - OpenRouter (300+ models via a single API key — recommended)\n- **@tanstack/ai-openai** - OpenAI (GPT series)\n- **@tanstack/ai-anthropic** - Anthropic (Claude)\n- **@tanstack/ai-gemini** - Google Gemini\n- **@tanstack/ai-vertex** - Gemini on Google Vertex AI. Claude, Grok, and Mistral on Vertex live on `@tanstack/ai-anthropic/vertex`, `@tanstack/ai-grok/vertex`, and `@tanstack/ai-mistral/vertex`.\n- **@tanstack/ai-ollama** - Ollama (local models)\n- **@tanstack/ai-groq** - Groq\n- **@tanstack/ai-grok** - xAI Grok\n- **@tanstack/ai-bedrock** - Amazon Bedrock (Claude, Nova, Llama, and more via AWS)\n- **@tanstack/ai-byteplus** - BytePlus (Seed chat, Seedance video, Seedream image, Seed Speech)\n- **@tanstack/ai-fal** - fal (image & video generation)\n- **@tanstack/ai-reactor** - Reactor (live world and video generation: Orbis, Happy Oyster, LingBot, Helios, FastH3)\n- **@tanstack/ai-worldlabs** - World Labs Marble (persistent 3D world generation)\n- **@tanstack/ai-llmgateway** - LLM Gateway (hundreds of models via one OpenAI-compatible endpoint, self-hostable)\n- **@tanstack/ai-cloudflare** - Cloudflare Workers AI (chat, embeddings, image, speech, transcription, evaluate) and AI Gateway routing\n- **@tanstack/ai-typesafe** - TypeSafe Jev (typed evaluate decisions)\n- **@tanstack/ai-ollaya** - local Ollaya `laya` models for typed evaluate decisions. No API key.\n- **@tanstack/ai-lovable** - Lovable AI Gateway (Google and OpenAI chat, image, video, embeddings, and speech via one project key)\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Quick Start](./quick-start) - Add streaming chat. Pick your framework at the top of the page.\n- [Quick Start: React Native](./quick-start-react-native) - Add mobile chat with Expo and a server-owned provider boundary\n- [Evaluate](../evaluate/evaluate) - Ask typed questions and branch on the answers\n- [Tools Guide](../tools/tools) - Learn about the isomorphic tool system\n- [API Reference](../api/ai) - Explore the full API\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\ntitle: Overview\nid: overview\norder: 1\ndescription: \"TanStack AI is a type-safe, provider-agnostic TypeScript SDK for building streaming chat, tool calling, and AI features that work across any framework.\"\nkeywords:\n  - tanstack ai\n  - ai sdk\n  - typescript ai\n  - streaming chat\n  - tool calling\n  - isomorphic tools\n  - framework agnostic\n  - llm sdk\n---\n\nTanStack AI is a lightweight, type-safe SDK for building production-ready AI experiences. Its framework-agnostic core provides type-safe tool/function calling, streaming responses, and first-class React and Solid integrations, with adapters for multiple LLM providers — enabling predictable, composable, and testable AI features across any stack.\n\nBuild a streaming React chat in [Basic Chat](../tutorials/basic-chat). The key stays in the tab.\n\nServe a tool, a resource, and a prompt in [Build an MCP Server](../tutorials/mcp-server).\n\nGenerate an image from a prompt in [Generate Image](../tutorials/generate-image).\n\nStream a typed table from `chat({ outputSchema })` in [Streaming Structured Table](../tutorials/streaming-structured-table).\n\nAdd three named agents (researcher, SEO, and writer) to a blog-writing chat in [Subagents](../tutorials/subagents).\n\n## Key Features\n\n- ✅ **Type-Safe** - Full TypeScript support with Zod schema inference\n- ✅ **Streaming** - Built-in streaming support for real-time responses\n- ✅ **Isomorphic Tools** - Define once with `toolDefinition()`, implement with `.server()` or `.client()`\n- ✅ **Framework Agnostic** - Core library works anywhere\n- ✅ **Multiple Providers** - OpenRouter, OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Ollama, and more\n- ✅ **Typed Decisions** - Ask `choice`, `score`, and `boolean` questions with `decide()`\n- ✅ **Approval Flow** - Built-in support for tool approval workflows\n- ✅ **Automatic Execution** - Both server and client tools execute automatically\n\nUsers can paste their own provider API keys in the browser. See [Bring Your Own Key](../advanced/byok).\n\n## Framework Agnostic\n\nThe framework-agnostic core of TanStack AI provides the building blocks for creating AI experiences in any environment, including:\n\n- **Next.js** - API routes and App Router\n- **TanStack Start** - React Start or Solid Start (recommended!)\n- **Remix 3** - Controllers return SSE. Call `createChat` in a `clientEntry` island\n- **React Native / Expo** - Native chat screens with `useChat`, absolute server URLs, and XHR streaming transports\n- **Express** - Node.js server\n- **React Router v7** - Loaders and actions\n\nTanStack AI lets you define a tool once and provide environment-specific implementations. Using `toolDefinition()` to declare the tool's input/output types and the server behavior with `.server()` (or a client implementation with `.client()`). These isomorphic tools can be invoked from the AI runtime regardless of framework.\n\n```typescript\nimport { chat, toolDefinition } from '@tanstack/ai'\nimport { openaiText } from '@tanstack/ai-openai'\nimport { z } from 'zod'\nimport { db } from './db'\n\n// Define a tool\nconst getProductsDef = toolDefinition({\n  name: 'getProducts',\n  description: 'Search for products by query',\n  inputSchema: z.object({ query: z.string() }),\n  outputSchema: z.array(z.object({ id: z.string(), name: z.string() })),\n})\n\n// Create server implementation\nconst getProducts = getProductsDef.server(async ({ query }) => {\n  return await db.products.search(query)\n})\n\n// Use in AI chat\nchat({\n  adapter: openaiText('gpt-5.2'),\n  messages: [{ role: 'user', content: 'Find products' }],\n  tools: [getProducts]\n})\n```\n\n## Core Packages\n\nThe TanStack AI ecosystem consists of several packages:\n\n### `@tanstack/ai`\nThe core AI library that provides:\n- AI adapter interface for connecting to LLM providers\n- Chat completion and streaming\n- Isomorphic tool/function calling system\n- Agent loop strategies\n- Type-safe tool definitions with `toolDefinition()`\n- Type-safe Model Options based on adapter & model selection\n- Type-safe content modalities (text, image, audio, video, document) based on model capabilities\n\n### `@tanstack/ai-client`\nA framework-agnostic headless client for managing chat state:\n- Message management with full type safety\n- Streaming support\n- Connection adapters (SSE, HTTP stream, custom)\n- Automatic tool execution (server and client)\n- Tool approval flow handling\n\n### `@tanstack/ai-react`\nReact hooks for TanStack AI:\n- `useChat` hook for chat interfaces\n- Automatic state management\n- Tool approval flow support\n- Type-safe message handling with `InferChatMessages`\n\n### `@tanstack/ai-solid`\nSolid hooks for TanStack AI:\n- `useChat` hook for chat interfaces\n- Automatic state management\n- Tool approval flow support\n- Type-safe message handling with `InferChatMessages`\n\n### `@tanstack/ai-octane`\nOctane hooks for TanStack AI:\n- `useChat` hook for chat interfaces\n- Same hook names as `@tanstack/ai-react`\n- Compiled by the Octane plugin from `.tsrx` source\n\n## Adapters\n\nWith the help of adapters, TanStack AI can connect to various LLM providers. Available adapters include:\n\n- **@tanstack/ai-openrouter** - OpenRouter (300+ models via a single API key — recommended)\n- **@tanstack/ai-openai** - OpenAI (GPT series)\n- **@tanstack/ai-anthropic** - Anthropic (Claude)\n- **@tanstack/ai-gemini** - Google Gemini\n- **@tanstack/ai-vertex** - Gemini on Google Vertex AI. Claude, Grok, and Mistral on Vertex live on `@tanstack/ai-anthropic/vertex`, `@tanstack/ai-grok/vertex`, and `@tanstack/ai-mistral/vertex`.\n- **@tanstack/ai-ollama** - Ollama (local models)\n- **@tanstack/ai-groq** - Groq\n- **@tanstack/ai-grok** - xAI Grok\n- **@tanstack/ai-bedrock** - Amazon Bedrock (Claude, Nova, Llama, and more via AWS)\n- **@tanstack/ai-byteplus** - BytePlus (Seed chat, Seedance video, Seedream image, Seed Speech)\n- **@tanstack/ai-fal** - fal (image & video generation)\n- **@tanstack/ai-reactor** - Reactor (live world and video generation: Orbis, Happy Oyster, LingBot, Helios, FastH3)\n- **@tanstack/ai-worldlabs** - World Labs Marble (persistent 3D world generation)\n- **@tanstack/ai-llmgateway** - LLM Gateway (hundreds of models via one OpenAI-compatible endpoint, self-hostable)\n- **@tanstack/ai-cloudflare** - Cloudflare Workers AI (chat, embeddings, image, speech, transcription, evaluate) and AI Gateway routing\n- **@tanstack/ai-typesafe** - TypeSafe Jev (typed evaluate decisions)\n- **@tanstack/ai-ollaya** - local Ollaya `laya` models for typed evaluate decisions. No API key.\n- **@tanstack/ai-lovable** - Lovable AI Gateway (Google and OpenAI chat, image, video, embeddings, and speech via one project key)\n\n## Next Steps\n\n- [Quick Start](./quick-start) - Add streaming chat. Pick your framework at the top of the page.\n- [Quick Start: React Native](./quick-start-react-native) - Add mobile chat with Expo and a server-owned provider boundary\n- [Evaluate](../evaluate/evaluate) - Ask typed questions and branch on the answers\n- [Tools Guide](../tools/tools) - Learn about the isomorphic tool system\n- [API Reference](../api/ai) - Explore the full API\n"}
